==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*pleh₂-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*ploskъ}}. Ultimately from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*pleh₂-||thin, flat}}.

===Pronunciation===
